LABEL 420.00 420.00 VIBRATORY FEEDERS\nEach tray shakes the sand along and off\nits end into the bin (WT1, WT2 weigh it).\nThe harder it shakes, the faster it feeds.\nHOW TO USE: S1 / S2 switch them; select a\nfeeder: Amplitude % sets how hard it shakes.
